        "original_id": "94b11d8d-d72f-598c-8c01-a114ad982e30",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christopher Walken, Allison Williams, Taylor Louderman\n- Productions: Peter Pan Live!, Peter Pan, The Deer Hunter\n- Places: Grumman Studios, Bethpage, New York\n- Organizations: NBC\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Taylor Louderman appeared as Wendy in NBC's live production of the musical \"Peter Pan\".\n- Peter Pan Live! featured a live production of the 1954 musical adaptation of \"Peter Pan\" televised from Grumman Studios in Bethpage, New York.\n- Allison Williams starred in Peter Pan Live! in the title role.\n- Christopher Walken played Captain Hook in Peter Pan Live!.\n- Christopher Walken won the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for portraying Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich in \"The Deer Hunter\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
